# ==============================================================================
# Niramaya Health AI - Environment Configuration (.env)
# Copy this file to ".env" in the project root for local email OTP delivery,
# and add the same keys in Render Dashboard -> Environment for live cloud delivery.
# ==============================================================================

# --- OPTION 1 (Recommended for Render Free Tier & Local): Brevo Email API ---
# Free 300 emails/day over HTTPS (never blocked by Render firewall)
# Sign up at https://www.brevo.com -> SMTP & API -> API Keys
# BREVO_API_KEY=xkeysib-your-brevo-api-key-here
# BREVO_SENDER_EMAIL=your-verified-email@gmail.com

# --- OPTION 2 (Works Locally & Paid Render): Gmail SMTP with App Password ---
# IMPORTANT: Use a 16-digit Google App Password (NOT your regular Gmail password).
# Create one at: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords (requires 2-Step Verification ON)
GMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
GMAIL_PASS=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx

# --- OPTION 3: Resend Email API ---
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_resend_api_key
# EMAIL_FROM=Niramaya Health AI <onboarding@resend.dev>

# --- Live AI Keys ---
# Google Gemini API (powers Gemini Health Assistant + BioGPT live biomedical mode)
# Get free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key

# Optional: Dedicated Ultra-Fast Free Groq API for BioGPT (separate provider from Gemini)
# Get 100% free key (no credit card) at: https://console.groq.com/keys
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_groq_api_key
